{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spiritus Sancti</i> is a first-person psychological horror game centered on ritual, faith, and the power of the spoken word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Father Nathaniel, a young priest sent to investigate a suspected possession inside a small apartment on Vayra Street. What begins as a routine investigation quickly turns into something far more sinister. <br> The entity is released. And now it is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/d6ccf78c571889b3c473775fd9dac2c2.poster.avif?t=1773307493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/d6ccf78c571889b3c473775fd9dac2c2.webm?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/d6ccf78c571889b3c473775fd9dac2c2.mp4?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apartment will not let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you try to escape, the door leads you back inside. The environment shifts, the presence grows stronger, and the woman you came to save is no longer just a victim.\u00a0She is the vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/baa062673ac0286d7662d3715a0d799b.poster.avif?t=1773307493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/baa062673ac0286d7662d3715a0d799b.webm?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/baa062673ac0286d7662d3715a0d799b.mp4?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only defense is the sacred language of the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your microphone, you <u>must</u> <strong>speak invocations aloud</strong> to repel the demon, weaken its influence, and survive the encounter. But the entity learns. It adapts. And faith alone may not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more the apartment begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.poster.avif?t=1773307493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.webm?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.mp4?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-Driven Exorcism</strong><br>Your microphone is an essential part of the gameplay. Speak ritual invocations to repel the entity, disrupt attacks, and perform sacred rites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Shifting Apartment</strong><br>The environment loops and evolves as the presence grows stronger. Familiar spaces slowly become something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Focus</strong><br>No weapons. No safe rooms. Only ritual, observation, and your voice stand between you and the entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Encounters</strong><br>The possessed  roams the apartment, hunting you through the dark. Every confrontation becomes a test of timing, faith, and nerve.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954460?t=1773307493","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954460?t=1773307493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/35662068d3a3c3681508dba00fd2ce1e167924c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773307493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/35662068d3a3c3681508dba00fd2ce1e167924c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773307493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Spiritus Sancti contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and disturbing imagery. Players will encounter graphic depictions of demonic possession, including unsettling transformations, aggressive behavior, and supernatural attacks. Some sequences include blood, injury detail, and gore consistent with violent struggle.\r\n\r\nThe narrative deals with mature themes such as religious rituals, death, psychological trauma, and the confrontation of malevolent entities."},"demos":[{"appid":3980740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spiritus Sancti</i> is a first-person psychological horror game centered on ritual, faith, and the power of the spoken word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Father Nathaniel, a young priest sent to investigate a suspected possession inside a small apartment on Vayra Street. What begins as a routine investigation quickly turns into something far more sinister. <br> The entity is released. And now it is hunting you.</p><p cla