 to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.poster.avif?t=1773307493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.webm?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/extras/4ce789c713ab2d69bc15c1af294d6e89.mp4?t=1773307493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-Driven Exorcism</strong><br>Your microphone is an essential part of the gameplay. Speak ritual invocations to repel the entity, disrupt attacks, and perform sacred rites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Shifting Apartment</strong><br>The environment loops and evolves as the presence grows stronger. Familiar spaces slowly become something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Focus</strong><br>No weapons. No safe rooms. Only ritual, observation, and your voice stand between you and the entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Encounters</strong><br>The possessed  roams the apartment, hunting you through the dark. Every confrontation becomes a test of timing, faith, and nerve.</p>","developers":["Divider Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954460/57f2ba1b4173fab60ce43993e6f730613d7cec3f/header.jpg?t=1773307493","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</str